    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p>Grading of lymphomatoid granulomatosis (adapted from the 2017 <em>WHO classification of tumours of haematopoietic and lymphoid tissues</em>)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Martina Deckert",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 58.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"78\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Lymphoid cells</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Transformed B&nbsp;cells</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">EBER+ lymphoid <span style=\"\">cells<sup>a</sup></span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Necrosis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 58.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"78\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Grade&nbsp;1</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Polymorphous background</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Rare or absent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&lt;&nbsp;40&nbsp;cells/mm<sup>2</sup> (&lt;&nbsp;5&nbsp;cells/HPF)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Focal or absent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 58.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"78\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Grade&nbsp;2</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Polymorphous background</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Single or in small clusters</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">40&ndash;400&nbsp;cells/mm<sup>2</sup> (5&ndash;50&nbsp;cells/HPF)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">More common</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 58.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"78\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Grade&nbsp;3</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Polymorphous background</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Large atypical B&nbsp;cells or aggregates</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&gt;&nbsp;400&nbsp;cells/mm<sup>2</sup> (&gt;&nbsp;50&nbsp;cells/HPF)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 98.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"131\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Extensive</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"\">EBER, EBV-encoded small RNA.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup><span style=\"\">a</span></sup><span style=\"\">Originally</span> reported per HPF of 0.16&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup>.</p>",
